{
  "name": "Build a local business lead list with validated emails using LeadMagic",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Local business leads with validated emails\n\n### How it works\n1. **Search settings** holds the place and business category.\n2. Local Leads search returns businesses with phones, emails, and websites.\n3. Each email is validated; invalid ones are dropped and unknown ones are kept for review.\n4. Leads are saved to a Google Sheet, keyed by listing ID so reruns update rows.\n\n### Setup\n1. Edit **Search settings**. Use **Get Categories** in the LeadMagic node to look up exact category names.\n2. Paste a sheet URL into **Save leads**.\n3. Select your LeadMagic and Google Sheets credentials.\n\n### Customization\nSwitch to a map search by adding Latitude, Longitude, and Radius in the Local Leads filters. Local Leads pages are free on Professional and Ultimate; validation charges only for valid or invalid results.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.8.0.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "82ee07eb-a948-5cae-b780-8067f9124f4e",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2c27e334-d6a4-54cf-8940-3fb559273eea",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a0",
              "name": "country",
              "value": "US",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "region_code",
              "value": "TX",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "city",
              "value": "Austin",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "category",
              "value": "plumb",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "max_leads",
              "value": 100,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b875121e-eef3-5be1-9cae-377a7bced99d",
      "name": "Search settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "localLead",
        "operation": "searchLocalLeads",
        "country": "={{ $json.country }}",
        "category_contains": "={{ $json.category }}",
        "localFilters": {
          "region_code": "={{ $json.region_code }}",
          "city": "={{ $json.city }}",
          "has_email": true,
          "exclude_closed": true
        },
        "limit": "={{ $json.max_leads }}"
      },
      "id": "a34d6e30-5b17-545b-a747-de96191bf6f3",
      "name": "Search local leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "email",
        "operation": "validateEmail",
        "inputMode": "single",
        "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "outputMode": "selected",
        "outputFields": [
          "email_status",
          "mx_provider"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0842c1c8-f12e-50ea-bb13-ea164891d4f5",
      "name": "Validate email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email_status }}",
              "rightValue": "invalid",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "18d18d87-f991-56a7-8c88-c70b3387729d",
      "name": "Drop invalid emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a0",
              "name": "Listing ID",
              "value": "={{ $('Search local leads').item.json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "Business",
              "value": "={{ $('Search local leads').item.json.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "Category",
              "value": "={{ $('Search local leads').item.json.category }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "Phone",
              "value": "={{ $('Search local leads').item.json.phone }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "Email",
              "value": "={{ $('Search local leads').item.json.email }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "Email Status",
              "value": "={{ $json.email_status ?? 'error' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a6",
              "name": "Website",
              "value": "={{ $('Search local leads').item.json.website }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a7",
              "name": "Address",
              "value": "={{ [$('Search local leads').item.json.street, $('Search local leads').item.json.city, $('Search local leads').item.json.region_code].filter(Boolean).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "df8034d1-7388-5bd5-b2ea-8bb69696741d",
      "name": "Lead row",
